      "notes": "Mainnet is out of scope by default; verification covers network-independent repo tools for 24-word BIP-39 generation with an empty passphrase and watch-only derivation at the fixed path m/84'/0'/0'/0/i, not live-network flows. M-38 requires 6 confirmations as policy only, without enforcement code; transaction construction and local signing are implemented in the web profile (offline, wallet-core AnySigner); local signing also exists as a test-only signer in tools/mainnet-signing (temporary unfunded credentials only); broadcast is not implemented anywhere; BTC/ETH/TRX share xpub version 0488b21e, so cross-chain xpub misuse is undetectable from serialisation alone."
